        <h4>What are the most important parts of a skincare routine?</h4>
        <p>Cleansing, moisturizing and daily sun protection form the foundation — everything else is tailored to your skin type and concerns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h4>How do I find out my skin type?</h4><p>Our dermatologists assess your skin during a consultation and recommend a routine suited to it.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h4>Why is it important to use a moisturizer?</h4><p>Moisturizer maintains your skin barrier and prevents excess oil production caused by dryness.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h4>What is the best way to handle sensitive skin?</h4><p>Use fragrance-free products and introduce new treatments gradually, under professional guidance.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h4>How can I reduce the oil production in my skin?</h4><p>A consistent, non-stripping routine paired with the right actives can help balance oil production.</p></div>
